// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceEvents, DeviceRegistryEvents
// purpose: RID Hijacking Technique and Detection
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/RID%20Hijacking%20Technique%20and%20Detection.kql
